# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vite production environment — baked into the bundle at `npm run build`.
#
# SAFE TO COMMIT: The anon key is a public key by design.
#   Security comes from Supabase Row Level Security (RLS) policies, not from
#   keeping this key secret. The service role key (SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY) must
#   NEVER appear here — it belongs only in HF Spaces Secrets / server env vars.
#
# HF Spaces note: HF injects secrets at runtime, not during docker build. Vite
#   variables must be present at build time. This committed file ensures the
#   production bundle connects to the real Supabase project, not the mock fallback.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

